{
  "_comment": [
    "Stage 0.3 unit dictionary. Key = lowercased unit token as written in the",
    "source. 'type' drives the Step 7.2 unit/concept compatibility check;",
    "'expansion' is the Step 0.2 unit-abbreviation expansion.",
    "Matching is done on a normalized form (case-folded, micro sign unified,",
    "superscripts flattened), so 'mg/dL', 'mg/dl' and 'MG/DL' all land here."
  ],

